OL,3,ATemperatures could climb to 28C in late
OL,4,Aburst of warmth
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as parts of central and
OL,7,Fsouthern Europe have been experiencing
OL,8,Fa spell of intense heat, with some
OL,9,Flocations exceeding 45C.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
