OL,3,AVolcano eruption leaves 150,000
OL,4,Apassengers stranded in Indonesia
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe volcano had started erupting late
OL,7,Fon Friday night, generating continuous
OL,8,Fseismic activity, lava fountains, and
OL,9,Fbooming sounds across surrounding
OL,10,Fregions. Two more eruptions happened
OL,11,Fearly on Sunday, authorities said.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
